[I] KDE PIM library for outgoing SMTP and Akonadi sending accounts

[T] KMailTransport is a KDE PIM library that manages mail transport settings
[T] and sends messages, either directly via SMTP or through Akonadi
[T] resources. It also provides widgets for configuring outgoing mail
[T] accounts.

